 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Update",
   "items": [
    "advanceColony asks ticksWanted for the speed, then steps one tick at a time",
    "At speed 2x and up, the loop stops when the 5 ms budget runs out",
    "Post-step work runs once per Update, after the last Step"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Draw",
   "items": [
    "The renderer reads World() and Snapshot(); both are memoised on tick and viewGen",
    "Layers draw in a fixed order (see render-pipeline)",
    "The HUD paints over the composited world"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "slate",
   "title": "Evidence",
